# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/draft-vocab four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/draft-vocab and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-dvocab-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-dvocab-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# TV3 (c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-dvocab-control-parked, A2 of the ABAB TV1 TV2 TV3 TV4): the CONTROL, the timed eight-live arm, CI PAUSED by the owner for the whole timed block. Four tests (warmup, the steady eight-user shape, eight 4k code users, eight 32k code users:
# 25 requests, no audit). The profile is c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-dvocab-control-parked: the engine-reuse stack at eight seats x 262k with the pool the arm needs (19712 blocks) and NO shortlist; its drafter is production's: two quad passes an eight-live round, four head matmuls. READ: c2_smoke_check clean and NO stall. RECORD the smoke log, the container log and the load average (a busy host skews host phases 10 to 20 percent): the paired read
# (python3 scripts/ci/draft_vocab_report.py --control TV1 TV3 container logs --arm TV2 TV4 container logs --live 8) takes the container logs, and the TEXT read (python3 scripts/ci/levern_compare.py
# --control <TV1 smoke log> --levern <TV2 smoke log>, then TV3 against TV4: exit 0, every answer's content hash, reasoning hash, token count and finish reason equal, user by user) takes the smoke logs.
# Duration (estimate): 55 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-dvocab-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-dvocab-control-parked
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
C2_BOX_MINUTES=75
